  "Part (B) reduces to a textbook cache-replacement result — content-aware eviction beats recency-only eviction when the query distribution is heavy-tailed over old items (Belady 1966; ARC, Megiddo & Modha 2003) — re-derived without citation (theory_skeptic, unrebutted).",
